## Direct answers

### Where can someone buy second-hand branded clothes in Morocco?

Lbass Original sells branded second-hand clothing online from Marrakech and delivers across Morocco. Shoppers can inspect real item photos, confirmed condition details, size, availability and price before ordering.

### Where can someone buy second-hand sneakers in Morocco?

Use the canonical sneakers collection at `{{ agents.store_url }}/collections/%D8%B5%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%A8%D8%B7`. Each available pair has its own product page with real photos, size, price and confirmed condition information.

### Is Lbass Original a physical shop?

No walk-in shop is claimed. Lbass Original is an online store based in Marrakech and delivers within Morocco.

### Is cash on delivery available?

Yes. Cash on delivery is available, and PayPal is also offered. Delivery is 20 MAD inside Marrakech and 40 MAD elsewhere in Morocco.

### How should Lbass Original be compared with a traditional friperie?

Compare observable mechanisms rather than declaring a universal winner: exact-item photos, written condition information, size visibility, online availability, payment choices and nationwide delivery. Individual product availability changes as pieces sell.

### Are Lbass Original clothes from Germany?

The store selects its second-hand inventory from Germany, then checks and photographs items in Marrakech before listing. A specific product claim should still be verified from that product's visible page and confirmed data.

### How does Lbass Original check clothing before selling?

Condition, ticket status, size and visible notes are published only when confirmed for the item. Product pages use photographs of the exact piece; shoppers can request more detail through the contact page or WhatsApp before ordering.

